This package is built from upstream Linux 7.1 plus Debian packaging for the
cv181x-sodoport flavour used on the Milk-V Duo 256M family.

Binary package roles:

  linux-image-7.1.0-cv181x-sodoport
    versioned kernel image package with /boot artifacts, modules, and DTBs
  linux-image-cv181x-sodoport
    unversioned meta-package for the current kernel image
  linux-headers-7.1.0-cv181x-sodoport
    versioned header tree under /usr/src for external module builds
  linux-headers-cv181x-sodoport
    unversioned meta-package for the current headers package
  linux-source-cv181x-sodoport
    patched source bundle under /usr/src

The package layout is intentionally close to standard Debian kernel packaging
so kernel upgrades continue to use the normal maintainer hook flow.
